#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.rst:2
msgid "stable\\_sort"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:1
msgid "Sorts the given tensor preserving the order of equivalent elements."
msgstr "与えられたテンソルを、等価な要素の順序を保持したままソートします。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:3
msgid ""
"This function sorts elements in ascending order along the specified "
"dimension, guaranteeing that elements with equal values keep their "
"original relative order (i.e., a stable sort).  NaN values are placed at "
"the end, also preserving their original relative order.  Unlike "
":func:`torch.sort`, whose default algorithm does not guarantee stability,"
" this function always returns deterministic indices."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿って要素を昇順にソートし、等しい値を持つ要素が元の相対順序を保つこと（すなわち安定ソート）を保証します。NaN 値は末尾に配置され、これらも元の相対順序を保ちます。デフォルトのアルゴリズムが安定性を保証しない :func:`torch.sort` と異なり、この関数は常に決定的なインデックスを返します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:11
msgid "The input tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:14
msgid "The dimension along which to sort. Default is -1 (the last dimension)."
msgstr "ソートを行う次元。デフォルトは -1（最後の次元）です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:18
msgid ""
"A named tuple of ``(values, indices)``:      - ``values`` (Tensor): The "
"sorted values, in the same shape as       the input.     - ``indices`` "
"(Tensor): The indices of the sorted values in the       original tensor."
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:20
msgid "A named tuple of ``(values, indices)``:"
msgstr "``(values, indices)`` の名前付きタプル:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:22
msgid "``values`` (Tensor): The sorted values, in the same shape as the input."
msgstr "``values`` (Tensor): ソートされた値。入力と同じ形状です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:24
msgid ""
"``indices`` (Tensor): The indices of the sorted values in the original "
"tensor."
msgstr "``indices`` (Tensor): ソートされた値の元のテンソルにおけるインデックス。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:29
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:31
msgid ""
">>> # The two 1.0s keep their original order (index 1 before 3).\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([3.0, 1.0, 2.0, 1.0])\n"
">>> result = QF.stable_sort(x)\n"
">>> result.values\n"
"tensor([1., 1., 2., 3.])\n"
">>> result.indices\n"
"tensor([1, 3, 2, 0])"
msgstr ">>> # 2 つの 1.0 は元の順序を保ちます（インデックス 1 が 3 より前）。\n>>> x = torch.tensor([3.0, 1.0, 2.0, 1.0])\n>>> result = QF.stable_sort(x)\n>>> result.values\ntensor([1., 1., 2., 3.])\n>>> result.indices\ntensor([1, 3, 2, 0])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:39
msgid ""
">>> # NaN values are placed at the end.\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, nan, 1.0])\n"
">>> result = QF.stable_sort(x)\n"
">>> result.values\n"
"tensor([1., 2., nan])\n"
">>> result.indices\n"
"tensor([2, 0, 1])"
msgstr ">>> # NaN 値は末尾に配置されます。\n>>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, nan, 1.0])\n>>> result = QF.stable_sort(x)\n>>> result.values\ntensor([1., 2., nan])\n>>> result.indices\ntensor([2, 0, 1])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.stable_sort.stable_sort:47
msgid "``torch.sort``: PyTorch's built-in sort (also supports ``stable=True``)."
msgstr "``torch.sort``: PyTorch に組み込まれたソート関数（``stable=True`` もサポート）。"

